{"version":3,"term":{"cols":124,"rows":34},"timestamp":1791087546,"command":"./examples/amend/record.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.948, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n\u001b[2m# A support team runs a chat agent and a voice agent on one shared memory.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\u001b[1m$ amend -beat seed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.216, "o", "\r\n== Seed: the history both agents share\r\n\r\n"]
[0.047, "o", "  2026-08-01 16:00  ops    policy memo recorded: 2 policies\r\n"]
[0.034, "o", "  2026-09-12 17:04  chat   Dana promises customer 4812 a refund exception\r\n"]
[0.024, "o", "  2026-09-20 15:30  voice  customer calls to use the exception; voice agent sees: exception approved (since Sep 12)\r\n"]
[5.008, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# Today a support lead revokes the exception in chat. The voice agent is asked next.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.004, "o", "\u001b[1m$ amend -beat correct\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "\r\n== Correct: one agent records the correction, the other answers from it\r\n\r\n"]
[0.025, "o", "  2026-10-04 04:19  chat   support lead revokes the exception\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  2026-10-04 04:19  voice  asked \"can I still use my refund exception?\" and sees: exception revoked (since Oct 4)\r\n\r\n  History of refund_exception for customer-4812:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "    2026-09-12 17:04  asserted  approved\r\n    2026-10-04 04:19  asserted  revoked\r\n"]
[7.006, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# The goodwill-credit policy is discontinued.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\u001b[1m$ amend -beat withdraw\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n== Withdraw: a discontinued policy leaves the beliefs and stays in the history\r\n\r\n"]
[0.011, "o", "  2026-10-04 04:19  ops    goodwill credit withdrawn\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n  Policies the voice agent can cite now:\r\n    - refunds within 30 days of purchase\r\n\r\n  History of policy:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "    2026-08-01 16:00  asserted  refunds within 30 days of purchase\r\n    2026-08-01 16:00  asserted  goodwill credit: $25 for outages over 4 hours\r\n    2026-10-04 04:19  withdrawn goodwill credit: $25 for outages over 4 hours\r\n"]
[6.008, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# The customer disputes the refund they asked for on Sep 20. What did the agents believe then?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\u001b[1m$ amend -beat timetravel\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "\r\n== Timetravel: the customer disputes the refund they asked for on Sep 20\r\n\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  As of 2026-09-20 15:30 UTC, the agents believed: refund_exception = approved\r\n  True since:  2026-09-12 17:04 UTC\r\n  Quote:       \"I've approved a refund exception for your annual Pro plan\"\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  Whole turn:  [chat, account 4812] Dana (support): I've approved a refund exception for your annual Pro plan. You can use it past the 30-day window.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n  Today the agents believe: refund_exception = revoked (since 2026-10-04 04:19 UTC)\r\n\r\n  The request on Sep 20 was made while the exception stood, so the company honors it.\r\n"]
[9.004, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# The dispute file: what was believed on Sep 20, checkable without our server.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.006, "o", "\u001b[1m$ amend -beat audit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n== Audit: what was believed about customer-4812 on Sep 20, as a file anyone can check\r\n\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  4 events, digest sha256:audit-v1:55455516ae429f390170aca005ab0b0b721b9afcb2a1b3518f3fdc18db234bf4\r\n  Written to amend-audit.json\r\n\r\n  Replayed from the file alone as of 2026-09-20 15:30 UTC, digest verified:\r\n    open_issue        refund requested under the 9/12 exception\r\n    plan              Pro annual\r\n    refund_exception  approved\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n  Check it yourself: go run ./cmd/recall-audit < amend-audit.json\r\n"]
[7.196, "x", "0"]
